<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Starting_Loadout">Starting Loadout</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Ironclad?veaction=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Starting Loadout" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Ironclad?action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Starting Loadout"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Starting_Relic">Starting Relic</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Ironclad?veaction=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Starting Relic" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Ironclad?action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Starting Relic"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<p><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Burning Blood" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Burning_Blood" title="Burning Blood"><img alt="BurningBlood.png" src="/images/thumb/BurningBlood.png/24px-BurningBlood.png?8523b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BurningBlood.png/36px-BurningBlood.png?8523b5 1.5x, /images/thumb/BurningBlood.png/48px-BurningBlood.png?8523b5 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Burning_Blood" title="Burning Blood">Burning Blood</a></span> - Heal for 6 HP at the end of combat. 
Can be replaced by <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Black Blood" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Black_Blood" title="Black Blood"><img alt="BlackBlood.png" src="/images/thumb/BlackBlood.png/24px-BlackBlood.png?e604f3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BlackBlood.png/36px-BlackBlood.png?e604f3 1.5x, /images/thumb/BlackBlood.png/48px-BlackBlood.png?e604f3 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Black_Blood" title="Black Blood">Black Blood</a></span>.
</p>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Starting_Deck">Starting Deck</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Ironclad?veaction=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Starting Deck" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Ironclad?action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Starting Deck"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strike (Ironclad)" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strike_(Ironclad)" title="Strike (Ironclad)"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strike_(Ironclad)" title="Strike (Ironclad)">Strike</a></span> x5</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Defend (Ironclad)" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Defend_(Ironclad)" title="Defend (Ironclad)"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Common.png?e5eaaf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Common.png?e5eaaf 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Defend_(Ironclad)" title="Defend (Ironclad)">Defend</a></span> x4</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Bash" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Bash" title="Bash"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Common.png?260b96 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Bash" title="Bash">Bash</a></span> x1</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Ironclad_Cards">Ironclad Cards</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Ironclad?veaction=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Ironclad Cards" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Ironclad?action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Ironclad Cards"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<p>There are a total of 72 regular cards in the Ironclad's card pool.
</p>
<ul><li><a href="/wiki/File:CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Common.png" class="image"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Common.png?e5eaaf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Common.png?e5eaaf 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Red&amp;rarity=Common"><span>Common Cards</span></a></span> x20</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/File:CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png" class="image"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png?64c48d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png?64c48d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Red&amp;rarity=Uncommon"><span>Uncommon Cards</span></a></span> x36</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/File:CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Rare.png" class="image"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Rare.png?78fe01" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Rare.png?78fe01 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Red&amp;rarity=Rare"><span>Rare Cards</span></a></span> x16</li></ul>
<p>A full list of Ironclad Cards can be found <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Red"><span>here</span></a></span>.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Unique_Relics">Unique Relics</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Ironclad?veaction=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Unique Relics" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Ironclad?action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Unique Relics"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
