</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Uncommon</b>
</td>
<td><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Paper Phrog" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Paper_Phrog" title="Paper Phrog"><img alt="PaperFrog.png" src="/images/thumb/PaperFrog.png/24px-PaperFrog.png?a89503" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PaperFrog.png/36px-PaperFrog.png?a89503 1.5x, /images/thumb/PaperFrog.png/48px-PaperFrog.png?a89503 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Paper_Phrog" title="Paper Phrog">Paper Phrog</a></span>, <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Self-Forming Clay" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Self-Forming_Clay" title="Self-Forming Clay"><img alt="SelfFormingClay.png" src="/images/thumb/SelfFormingClay.png/24px-SelfFormingClay.png?80d861" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/SelfFormingClay.png/36px-SelfFormingClay.png?80d861 1.5x, /images/thumb/SelfFormingClay.png/48px-SelfFormingClay.png?80d861 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Self-Forming_Clay" title="Self-Forming Clay">Self-Forming Clay</a></span>
