<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Lore">Lore</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Ironclad?veaction=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section: Lore" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Ironclad?action=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Lore"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<ul><li>When completing the Act 3 event <span class="event-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Sensory Stone" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Sensory_Stone" title="Sensory Stone"><img alt="EventClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/20px-EventClear.png?8b40cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/30px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EventClear.png/40px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 2x" data-file-width="74" data-file-height="74" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Sensory_Stone" title="Sensory Stone">Sensory Stone</a></span>, you 'recall' what appear to be memories regarding the pasts of the characters. The <span class="ts-red">FEAR</span> dialogue option may recall a battle between the <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Ironclad</a> and some demonic creature.</li></ul>
<blockquote><i><p><span class="ts-red ts-up"><span style="--i:0">FEAR.</span></span> <br />
</p><p>A demonic creature towers above you, wings spread wide as it howls with laughter. Dead bodies of a tribe surround you while the village is engulfed in terrible <span class="ts-purple ts-up"><span style="--i:0">dark</span> <span style="--i:1">flames.</span></span> <br />
</p><p>The demon calls out, taunting you. <br />
</p><p>"<span class="ts-red ts-shake"><span style="--i:0">YOU</span> <span style="--i:1">REALLY</span> <span style="--i:2">ARE</span> <span style="--i:3">THE</span> <span style="--i:4">STRONGEST</span> <span style="--i:5">NOW!</span> <span style="--i:6">Haha...</span> <span style="--i:7">HEHE...</span> <span style="--i:8">HAHAHAAAAH!!</span></span>" <br />
</p><p>This laughter echoes forever...
</p></i><p><i>
</i></p></blockquote>
<ul><li>This demon may be <a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Vakuu" title="Slay the Spire 2:Vakuu">Vakuu</a> and/or related to the demon depicted in the card art for <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Demon Form" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Demon_Form" title="Demon Form"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Power Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png?baa309" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png?baa309 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Demon_Form" title="Demon Form">Demon Form</a></span>, or the hand depicted in <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Burning Pact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Burning_Pact" title="Burning Pact"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png?64c48d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png?64c48d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Burning_Pact" title="Burning Pact">Burning Pact</a></span>.</li></ul>
<ul><li>The Ironclad's name is not Steve.<sup id="cite&#95;ref-1" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-1"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>1<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>
<div class="mw-references-wrap"><ol class="references">
<li id="cite&#95;note-1"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><a href="#cite_ref-1">↑</a></span> <span class="reference-text"><a rel="nofollow" class="external free" href="https://www.megacrit.com/news/2025-10-16-neowsletter-issue-15/">https://www.megacrit.com/news/2025-10-16-neowsletter-issue-15/</a></span>
</li>
</ol></div>
